<title>USA: Tridex says to buy back up to $1.2 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Tridex says to buy back up to $1.2 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WESTPORT, Conn. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tridex Corp said Thursday its board has authorized the repurchase of up to $1.2 million of its common stock in open market transactions.</p>
<p>The company said shares acquired under the repurchase program, which is expected to begin immediately, will be used for stock option programs and for other corporate purposes.</p>
